- CARGO_TARGET_AARCH64_UNKNOWN_LINUX_MUSL_RUNNER=qemu-aarch64 cargo test --locked --offline -p pocketboot --target aarch64-unknown-linux-musl: all 223 tests passed under user-mode QEMU.
